イバル心を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、不審な行動を取っている主人公を密かにマークしていた彼女は、主人公が女子学生に性的な悪戯をしている現場を目撃し、それをネタに主人公をゆするが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14471","sourceWorkId":"13009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会の副会長。学園理事長の娘で何事も一番でないと気がすまない性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今年3年生となり、生徒会会長は当然自分だと考えていたが選挙で負け、会長に選ばれた主人公に対して強いライバル心を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、学園長の指示により怪しげな行動を取っている主人公を、彼女は密かに追跡し会長職から引き摺り下ろす情報を得ようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてついに主人公の痴態（部活廃部への行動）を目撃した彼女は、脅しをかけようとするが逆に襲われてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58986"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58986","value":"3年生"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14471","sourceWorkId":"13009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14471","sourceWorkId":"13009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14471","sourceWorkId":"13009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"50 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14471","sourceWorkId":"13009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d15ecfa141aa78a957d0721f246eb9167f15cebb8da4b9b89088465bd5c0c91.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e732af01cd336928c98cbca9ec24f02c704a94b7fd35da7e6c1ae9d4fceb531f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"きみづか縁","creatorId":"vndb:s828","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s828","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s828","name":"きみづか 縁","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224928:58986:6036:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"